          "worked": "From the graphs, $f(3)=2$ and $g(2)=2$.\n$$\\begin{align*}g(f(3))&=g(2)\\\\g(f(3))&=2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
